[Options]

[A.]
<h2>The Reckoning</h2>
<i>~y"You need a fast flying train on a tornado track to shoot you somewhere, and shoot you back."<br>
--~mBob Dylan~w</i>
<p>"Holy S#|% !!!" You scream as your peaceful dreams are shattered by the sound of a warcry. You leap from bed and look outside only to see a battle underway...Closer inspection tells you that these are the furies, they have surprised  you, but the Queen has managed a small defence. Put a pair of pants on and finish this once and for all.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Thats All She Wrote...</h2>
<p>You reign supreme in Nimbus !!! Now priests will be sacrificing priests to you and The Queen. Of course, after the idea sets in you think to yourself, "Wouldn't it be nice to have ALL the power..." But thats another story... Those of you with a keen eye, noticed a "treason" spell in that game, those of you that are skilless may have even used it to get here, but the pros know that the only reason its there is in case your ally snags a priest and decides not to sacrifice it, you can treason the transport and sacrifice it yourself.
<p>Thanks for playing my campaign, I hope it was fun, and somewhat challenging. I wish I could give you more for beating it, but this is a pretty limited interface. What I can do however and tell you to go here: ~m<a href="http://members.tripod.com/~BarkingMonkey/netstorm/winner.html">MY TROPHY PAGE</a>~w and display the trophy wherever you please :)
L8R
<p>~y=S~kï~ySPU~w*~y=~rB~g@~yr~mK~b|~rN~gG~yM~m÷~b—~rk~gÍ~yY~mô
