[ai2TempleDead]
<h2>My Temple !!!!</h2>
<p>I fear I can no longer bridge my friend, for my temple is lost.

[ai2PriestDead]
<h2>The Queen Falls...</h2>
<p>After the Queen's untimely demise, the enemy swoops around in behind you and make one hell of a mess. Your blood spills on the alter of the furies, and there is no re-incarnation, no afterlife, just blackness...
$Button=Try Again,Tell,TryAgain
